<% content_for :title, "Confianza — La red de confianza que fortalece tu comunidad" %>

<%# Hero %>
<section class="py-16 md:py-28 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-high rounded-full">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" style="font-size:18px">location_on</span>
        <span class="text-label-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Red social geolocalizada</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-xl text-primary-container">
        La red de confianza que fortalece tu comunidad
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl">
        Reputación basada en hechos, créditos comunitarios y vecinos reales cerca de ti.
        Una plataforma para intercambiar, ayudar y construir capital social en tu territorio,
        sin depender del sistema financiero tradicional.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-2">
        <%= link_to signup_path,
              class: "bg-primary hover:bg-organic-green-deep text-on-primary px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-label-md transition-colors shadow-sm flex justify-center items-center gap-2" do %>
          Unirse a la red
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:20px">arrow_forward</span>
        <% end %>
        <%= link_to "Cómo funciona", how_it_works_path,
              class: "border-2 border-primary text-primary px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-label-md hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors flex justify-center items-center" %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative h-[400px] md:h-[500px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden ambient-shadow">
      <%= image_tag "huertawor.png",
            alt: "Vecinos colaborando en un proyecto comunitario",
            class: "w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl" %>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-md p-4 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary-container shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-filled">handshake</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-label-md text-on-surface">Intercambio exitoso</p>
          <p class="text-caption text-on-surface-variant">María y Juan acaban de colaborar</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# Cómo funciona — resumen 3 pasos %>
<section class="py-20 bg-surface-container-low px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-primary-container mb-4">
        Cómo funciona Confianza
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Participar es simple. Tu valor en la red se basa en tus acciones reales,
        no en tu cuenta bancaria.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <%# Paso 1 %>
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-8 ambient-shadow flex flex-col items-start border-t-2 border-secondary group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:28px">add_circle</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">Publica</h3>
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex-grow">
          Ofrece tus habilidades, herramientas o tiempo. También puedes publicar
          lo que necesitas de la comunidad.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-secondary text-label-md">
          Paso 1 <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1" style="font-size:16px">arrow_right_alt</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%# Paso 2 %>
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-8 ambient-shadow flex flex-col items-start border-t-2 border-primary group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:28px">sync_alt</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">Interactúa</h3>
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex-grow">
          Conecta con tus vecinos. Realiza intercambios justos usando los
          créditos mutuos del sistema en lugar de dinero fiduciario.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-primary text-label-md">
          Paso 2 <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1" style="font-size:16px">arrow_right_alt</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%# Paso 3 %>
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-8 ambient-shadow flex flex-col items-start border-t-2 border-earth-clay group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:28px">verified</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">Evalúa</h3>
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex-grow">
          Confirma el intercambio y deja una reseña. Cada interacción exitosa
          fortalece tu nivel de confianza en la red.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-earth-clay text-label-md">
          Paso 3 <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1" style="font-size:16px">arrow_right_alt</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <%= link_to how_it_works_path,
            class: "inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary text-label-md hover:underline" do %>
        Ver explicación completa
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:18px">arrow_forward</span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# Reputación %>
<section class="py-20 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-[1280px] mx-auto" id="reputacion">
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="order-2 md:order-1 relative">
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 ambient-shadow-lg border border-outline-variant/20 max-w-sm mx-auto relative z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="relative">
            <img alt="Avatar de Elena García"
                 class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-surface"
                 src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCckTtkuHStFGZ3Zeu2Ul-_uTiG9_M68C0fjp23u7zTaWHHXg7xiYzF254di2-qYHk1YZ449Awmo6PEQtDbWS17iJqMbaiQcnerIxJCawKLEo12dmQXjqnU5jnU3uOmQ3lpXjQQ5VGejijflCfhLX9tbXe5RA1X_KBsxR-sKM8mHYjIXRJIv1EFKNmRK0QoXatCTI4sEP5TiErEXZmmquLAqgYQUgMnpZAXQEXMIFmOW2oYFytEkYS3nV781OI3w13XK2DvP5fBmqk">
            <div class="absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-earth-clay flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-surface">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-filled text-on-secondary" style="font-size:12px">check</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-headline-md text-on-surface text-lg">Elena García</h4>
            <p class="text-caption text-on-surface-variant">Vecina Verificada</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1">
              <span class="text-label-md text-on-surface">Nivel de Confianza</span>
              <span class="text-label-md text-primary">Nivel 4</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-1 h-2">
              <div class="flex-1 bg-primary rounded-l-full"></div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-primary"></div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-primary"></div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-primary"></div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-variant rounded-r-full"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex justify-between">
            <div class="text-center">
              <p class="text-headline-md text-on-surface text-xl">42</p>
              <p class="text-caption text-on-surface-variant">Intercambios</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <p class="text-headline-md text-on-surface text-xl">4.9</p>
              <p class="text-caption text-on-surface-variant">Valoración</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <p class="text-headline-md text-on-surface text-xl">150</p>
              <p class="text-caption text-on-surface-variant">Créditos</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[120%] h-[120%] bg-soft-sky/30 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 md:order-2 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-high rounded-full">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" style="font-size:18px">shield_person</span>
        <span class="text-label-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Tu historial es tu aval</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-primary-container">
        Reputación basada en acciones reales
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
        En Confianza, tu capacidad crediticia no la define un banco, sino tu historial de
        participación comunitaria. Cada vez que cumples un compromiso o ayudas a un vecino,
        tu "Nivel de Confianza" aumenta.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 pt-2">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-filled text-primary mt-1">star</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md text-on-surface">Reseñas transparentes</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
              Feedback bidireccional tras cada intercambio para mantener la calidad de la red.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-filled text-earth-clay mt-1">trending_up</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md text-on-surface">Acceso progresivo</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
              A mayor nivel, puedes solicitar préstamos de herramientas más valiosas
              o créditos mayores.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-filled text-tertiary mt-1">location_on</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md text-on-surface">Reputación territorial</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
              Tu confianza se construye en el barrio donde realmente estás. Lo local
              tiene más peso.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# CTA final %>
<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-[1280px] mx-auto pb-20">
  <div class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary rounded-xl px-8 py-12 md:px-16 md:py-16 text-center md:text-left md:flex md:items-center md:justify-between gap-8 ambient-shadow-lg">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-primary mb-3">
        Empieza a construir capital comunitario
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-on-primary-container">
        Únete gratis, descubre lo que tu zona tiene para ofrecer y empieza a construir
        tu reputación desde tu primer intercambio.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center mt-6 md:mt-0 shrink-0">
      <%= link_to "Crear cuenta", signup_path,
            class: "bg-on-primary text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-low px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-label-md transition-colors shadow-sm" %>
      <%= link_to "Ingresar", new_session_path,
            class: "border-2 border-on-primary text-on-primary px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-label-md hover:bg-primary transition-colors" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
